Z||000010||samoht||11-06-2001||04:38 PM||||300 ponies.. good luck.. I am 2,00 into my 3.2 and it cranks 200HP..  Maybe a turbo i could get 3 out of it.  But on pump gas.. NO WAY ..  2.8 + 3.1 crank + 3.1 steal head pistons + 3.1 flywheel ( if manual ) + bored .030 over .. I cut my head decks and heads surfaces down .010 = 3.2(3.194 really) / 9:1 compression<P>85gt3.2||||reg||1
